    <briefdescription>
<para>Helper class to hold instructions that are inside recurrence cycles. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The recurrence cycle is formulated around 1) a def operand and its tied use operand, or 2) a def operand and a use operand that is commutable with another use operand which is tied to the def operand. In the latter case, index of the tied use operand and the commutable use operand are maintained with CommutePair. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
